OL,3,GNEWSA'End of days' atmosphere at
OL,4,AStormont as party relationships
OL,5,Adeteriorate
OL,6,
OL,7,FTake Stormont, throw in a looming
OL,8,Fassembly election, add fresh rows over
OL,9,Fthe Irish language and the ingredients
OL,10,Ffor another Christmas crisis are all
OL,11,Fthere.
OL,13,FIt's certainly a tried-and-tested
OL,14,Frecipe and one some feel is about to be
OL,15,Frepeated, with Alliance Party
OL,16,FAgriculture Minister Andrew Muir saying
OL,17,Fthere's an "end of days" atmosphere
OL,18,Fabout the place.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
