OL,3,GNEWSA'End of days' atmosphere at
OL,4,AStormont as party relationships
OL,5,Adeteriorate
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere's no doubt relations between the
OL,8,Flargest parties sharing power - Sinn
OL,9,FFein and the Democratic Unionist Party
OL,10,F(DUP) - are as bad as they can be and
OL,11,Fhave been deteriorating for months.
OL,13,FWhat was already a difficult form of
OL,14,Fdoing government has undoubtedly been
OL,15,Fmade even harder by the fallout from
OL,16,Fthe Drumcree parading dispute.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
